    "phase": "R0 — lexicon (lex/video.edn, com.etzhayyim.utsushie.video, U1–U6 structural gates) + offline render-plan builder (methods/render_plan.py: build_plan + R0-gated render + CharterRefusal) + 9 standalone tests (methods/test_render_plan.py, ./run_tests.sh green). Design + offline planning only; NO render, NO publish.",
    "scopeBoundary": "Turn a kawaraban :article into a charter-bounded video plan (narration ≤ excerpt, link-out, neutral narrator); never render, never publish at R0",
